    {
      "file": "data-analyst-vs-ai-engineer-career-india-summary.webp",
      "mobile": "data-analyst-vs-ai-engineer-career-india-summary-mobile.webp",
      "alt": "A short visual summary of Data Analyst Vs AI Engineer.",
      "caption": "Key points at a glance.",
      "heading": "Data Analytics Is a Genuine, Well-Paying Career",
      "content": {
        "kind": "bundle",
        "sourceNeedCount": 4,
        "blocks": [
          {
            "needId": "detail:1",
            "type": "detail",
            "heading": "There Is No Universal Winner Here",
            "kind": "items",
            "items": [
              {
                "heading": "",
                "text": "Data analytics wins on entry accessibility: it accepts commerce, economics, statistics, engineering, or even humanities graduates, the interview bar leans on SQL, Excel, and one BI tool rather than production code, and the sheer volume of open roles across every industry in India is far higher."
              },
              {
                "heading": "",
                "text": "AI engineering wins on long-term pay ceiling and technical advantage: it pays more at almost every experience level once you clear the entry bar, and it opens a direct road toward building the systems that companies are now racing to put into production."
              }
            ],
            "sourceSectionId": "short-answer",
            "sourceNeedIndex": 1
          },
          {
            "needId": "detail:6",
            "type": "detail",
            "heading": "Questions Before You Commit to Either Path",
            "kind": "items",
            "items": [
              {
                "heading": "",
                "text": "A salary chart cannot tell you which one fits your actual situation and current skill floor."
              },
              {
                "heading": "",
                "text": "Data analytics rewards people who get real satisfaction from finding a clean, trustworthy answer inside messy business data and explaining it clearly."
              },
              {
                "heading": "",
                "text": "If the idea of spending several quiet hours debugging why a pipeline broke sounds interesting rather than exhausting, that is a real AI-engineering signal."
              }
            ],
            "sourceSectionId": "checkpoint",
            "sourceNeedIndex": 6
          },
          {
            "needId": "detail:7",
            "type": "detail",
            "heading": "Stepping Stone to AI Engineer",
            "kind": "items",
            "items": [
              {
                "heading": "",
                "text": "If AI engineering is a genuine goal, not a title you feel pressured into, starting as a data analyst is one of the more natural on-ramps available, not a detour."
              },
              {
                "heading": "",
                "text": "Do not rush this stage."
              },
              {
                "heading": "",
                "text": "Most data analyst roles use statistics lightly."
              }
            ],
            "sourceSectionId": "stepping-stone",
            "sourceNeedIndex": 7
          },
          {
            "needId": "detail:8",
            "type": "detail",
            "heading": "Mistakes to Avoid When Making This Decision",
            "kind": "items",
            "items": [
              {
                "heading": "",
                "text": "A higher headline number is not the same as a realistic first move."
              },
              {
                "heading": "",
                "text": "Both fields are crowded with certificate-holders who have never shipped anything real."
              }
            ],
            "sourceSectionId": "mistakes",
            "sourceNeedIndex": 8
          }
        ]
      },
      "type": "summary",
      "title": "Data Analytics Is a Genuine, Well-Paying Career"
    },
